Gamemode icons reference built-in Minecraft texture identifiers directly or
composite them in memory at runtime from the player's active resource packs
(with programmatic pixel-text fallbacks when a texture does not exist on an
older Minecraft version); no Minecraft or third-party textures are packaged.

Versions up to and including 1.2.1 shipped PvPTiers, PvPHQ and SubTiers
icon textures taken from TierTagger (https://github.com/mctiers-dev/TierTagger),
which were licensed separately. Version 1.2.2 replaced them with original
project artwork, and 1.2.3 switched to the built-in Minecraft texture
references and runtime composites described above.

PvPTiers, PvPHQ, SubTiers and NovaTiers are the property of their respective owners.
Just-Tiers is an unofficial client and is not affiliated with or endorsed by
any of them.
